Package: playbase.ingest
Type: Package
Title: Data Ingestion for OmicsPlayground
Version: 0.1.0
Author: BigOmics Analytics SA
Maintainer: The package maintainer <ivo.kwee@bigomics.com>
Description: Readers and input validation for OmicsPlayground datasets:
    delimited count, sample and contrast tables, platform exports
    (Olink NPX, Spectronaut, 10X Cell Ranger, h5/h5ad, Seurat), GEO and
    ArrayExpress downloads, GMT gene sets, and the upload checks run
    before a pgx object is built. A leaf dependency of playbase.
License: Dual Commercial and Non-Commercial
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    bit64,
    data.table,
    Matrix,
    methods,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
