    GEOquery,
    msa,
    MultiAssayExperiment,
    OlinkAnalyze,
    org.Hs.eg.db,
    R.utils,
    recount,
    rhdf5,
    Seurat,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
